stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> submitted: estudante se candidata
    submitted --> under_review: empresa analisa
    submitted --> withdrawn: estudante desiste
    under_review --> approved: empresa aprova (termos + seguro)
    under_review --> rejected: empresa rejeita
    under_review --> withdrawn: estudante desiste
    approved --> agreement_pending: agreement.generated (evento)
    agreement_pending --> active: agreement.approved (evento)
    active --> completed: conclusão
    active --> terminated: rescisão
    rejected --> [*]
    withdrawn --> [*]
    completed --> [*]
    terminated --> [*]
    note right of approved: qualquer outra transição → HTTP 409
